# Responsive Dashboard

A responsive dashboard built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
It works smoothly on all devices (mobile, tablet, and desktop).

## Features
- Fully responsive design
- Clean and modern UI
- Mobile-friendly navigation menu
- Interactive elements using JavaScript

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (Vanilla)

## Purpose
This project was created to practice building responsive user interfaces and improving frontend development skills.

